{"partie":"beta3","galaxie":"galaxie2","forum":4,"topic":3217,"titre":"Le Cul-te de Travia","forum_nom":"Marché galactique : discussions commerciales","pages":1,"messages":{"1":[{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"22/05 15:51","score":0,"id":72475,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nBien le bonjour mes frères et soeurs!\nMoi Trichelieu, grand prêtre de Travia propose mes services de marchands, j'accepte tout type de paiement.\nDevis par MP.\nDiner par MP.\nSoirée par MP.\nNuit quand vous voulez!\n\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Vladimir Harkonnen","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/208.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/05 16:00","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":72489,"texte":"Vous prennez les payments en nature ? Juste par simple curiosité..."},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"22/05 17:31","score":0,"id":72595,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nOui, tout à fait!\n\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Gemnoth-Sinn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/720.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/05 17:36","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":72598,"texte":"A combien estimez-vous mon corps? et celui d'Anko?"},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"22/05 17:44","score":0,"id":72609,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nLe votre? Existe t'il des fractions de leems?\nPar contre Anko! Je propose disons, 8 milles milliards!\n\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Gemnoth-Sinn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/720.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/05 17:46","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":72610,"texte":"Si le corps est quelque peu...Heu... \"refroidit\", ça ne pose pas de problème?"},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"22/05 17:52","score":0,"id":72621,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nAh non, elle doit être fraiche et vivante...\nComme un bon grog, \"ché bon, mé ché cho!\"\n\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"24/05 14:54","score":0,"id":74327,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nVente !\n\n150 millions d'unité de frégates porte-nefs!\n\n20 000 l'unité.\n\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Gemnoth-Sinn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/720.jpg","date_sans_annee":"24/05 15:02","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":74340,"texte":"J'en prend 500 000"},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"24/05 15:05","score":0,"id":74347,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"517 400 ou 477 600... au choix je n'ai pas plus proche de ce que vous voulez.\"\"\"\"\"\""},{"auteur":"Gemnoth-Sinn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/720.jpg","date_sans_annee":"24/05 15:07","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":74354,"texte":"Va pour 477 600"},{"auteur":"Trichelieu","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1422.gif","date_sans_annee":"24/05 15:10","score":0,"id":74358,"texte":"\"\"\"\"\"\"\nC'est envoyé mon biquet.\n\"\"\"\"\"\""}]}}